<title>NEW ZEALAND: Kevin Roberts steps down at Lion Nathan.</title>
<headline>Kevin Roberts steps down at Lion Nathan.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lion Nathan Ltd chief operating officer Kevin Roberts is to step down and will not be replaced, the company said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Lion will be run under three divisions -- beer, China and softdrinks.</p>
<p>Roberts will remain on Lion's board in a non executive role from February 1997.</p>
